\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{1}[y]_{y=0}^{y=z{e}^{x}}\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{1}z{e}^{x}\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{e}^{x}{[\\frac{1}{2}{z}^{2}]}_{z=0}^{z=1}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{x}\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[{e}^{x}]_{x=-1}^{x=0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{0}-{e}^{-1}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\frac{1}{e}) \\\\  & =\\frac{e-1}{2e}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347644 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347645 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347646 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347647 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347648 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1041 "selection" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347645 13194139535406 true] [17592186347643 1110 #uuid "e6ae9075-5335-5400-a701-b07e72d6dba9" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347644 1034 "\\frac{3}{e}" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347644 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347644 1111 #uuid "882994b6-69aa-50aa-b14d-2f9d2a9d3f9f" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347645 1034 "\\frac{e-1}{2e}" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347645 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347645 1111 #uuid "c58dd086-1953-550c-915e-10ddc96d3af1" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347646 1034 "2e" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347646 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347646 1111 #uuid "25904396-86ff-583a-baec-c71d9c5fdfd9" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347647 1034 "\\frac{3{e}^{2}-1}{e}" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347647 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347647 1111 #uuid "6d63adfe-df0d-5d07-9ff7-2fe1bc9aacec" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347648 1034 "\\frac{2-{e}^{2}}{2e}" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347648 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347648 1111 #uuid "3bad839d-5b62-53a6-9511-b96cf5045815" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347649 1017 #edb/ref 17592186347650 13194139535406 true] [17592186347649 1089 "q-161685" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347649 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535406 true] [17592186347649 1100 "Find the volume of the solid region enclosed by the $xz$-plane and the surface $y=5-3{z}^{2},$ and the planes $x=0,$ $x=1,$ $z=-1,$ $z=0.$" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347649 1113 #uuid "bfad8f1e-d853-5761-8ae8-4b4f0145a00b" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347649 1145 "Notice that our solid can be written as a type III region: \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,-1\\le z\\le 0,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 5-3{z}^{2}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of $R$ is given by the following triple integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & ={∭}_{R}\\text{d}V \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{5-3{z}^{2}}dy\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}[y]_{y=0}^{y=5-3{z}^{2}}\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}5-3{z}^{2}\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[5z-{z}^{3}]_{z=-1}^{z=0}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}0-(5(-1)-(-1)^{3})\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}5-1\\,dx \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{1}dx \\\\  & =4[x]_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =4(1-0) \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347651 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347652 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347653 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347654 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347655 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1041 "selection" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347655 13194139535406 true] [17592186347650 1110 #uuid "ea23cd1f-94bd-53d4-8d68-1df5aef6bb8d" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347651 1034 "\\frac{8}{3}" 131941