 volume of $R$ is given by the following triple integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & ={∭}_{R}\\text{d}V \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x/2}{\\int }_{0}^{4-2x-4z}dy\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x/2}[y]_{y=0}^{y=4-2x-4z}\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x/2}(4-2x-4z)-0\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x/2}4-2x-4z\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[(4-2x)z-2{z}^{2}]}_{z=0}^{z=1-x/2}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}((4-2x)(1-\\frac{x}{2})-2{(1-\\frac{x}{2})}^{2})-0\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(1-\\frac{x}{2})((4-2x)-2(1-\\frac{x}{2}))\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}(2-x)(2-x)\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}2-2x+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,dx \\\\  & ={[2x-{x}^{2}+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}]}_{x=0}^{x=2} \\\\  & =(2(2)-{2}^{2}+\\frac{{2}^{3}}{6})-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347714 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347715 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347716 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347717 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347718 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1041 "selection" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347716 13194139535406 true] [17592186347713 1110 #uuid "5083bed3-a6ab-54e3-843d-140238769cc1" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347714 1034 "\\frac{6}{5}" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347714 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347714 1111 #uuid "3dbc590d-b682-5c2c-963f-f3964523b956" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347715 1034 "2" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347715 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535406 true] [17592186347715 1111 #uuid "f8096c88-b6fb-5bfe-be35-10cb080537c8" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347716 1034 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139535406 true] [17592186347716 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1319